OL,3,AApple ordered to pay $5.7bn after
OL,4,Alosing vibration tech patent suit
OL,5,
OL,6,FApple said it had not used Taction's
OL,7,Fvibration tech and would appeal the
OL,8,Fverdict.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/19
