OL,3,AMistakes to avoid when buying
OL,4,AGlastonbury tickets
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe festival has introduced an
OL,7,Fautomatic queuing system on the day of
OL,8,Fthe sale. But for those anxious about
OL,9,Fsecuring a place, we have rounded up
OL,10,Fsome hardened festival-goers' advice on
OL,11,Fthe biggest pitfalls to avoid.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG15/19
